.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-db-profile 1  "xil-db-profile " 
.SH NAME
xil\-db\-profile \- Profile MP3 audio levels: peak, average, and minimum dBFS
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-db\-profile\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-absolute\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Profile MP3 audio levels: peak, average, and minimum dBFS
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write results to FILE as CSV in addition to logging
.TP
\fB\-\-absolute\fR
Print absolute paths (default: relative to scan root)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output a JSON array to stdout — no banner, safe to pipe to jq
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: __sfx_default__]
MP3 file or directory to scan recursively (default: workspace SFX/ folder)
